==Description==
The '''Pastel Nametag''' is a nametag that can be obtained at Level 14 of the regular [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|410}} ({{Robux|49}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) or {{Robux|58}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|2,460}} or {{Robux|830}} ({{Robux|699}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

The '''Pastel Nametag''' has has a green to pink gradient text and outline. Behind ht text, colorful smoke colored like the text, grey wind and small pink and blue sparkles can be seen.

